            "review_title": "Review at Buffet Poseidon Lê Văn Lương",
            "review_text": "Petitgiaco\nChambery, France477 contributions\n0\nNew Year's Eve at Poseidon in Hanoi\nDec 2024 • Friends\nGenerally not a fan of buffets though it was a nice surprise. Not a lot of people... well, it's all relative.\nVery very well made products. A wide choice of sea food: crabs, lobsters, large shrimps, cooked oysters, a multitude of cheese shells, sushi, various cooked fish, desserts, fruits... it was very good but as always in restaurants we eat too much. The room was nice and the service at the top. We ended the year 2024 well.\nRead more\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten January 1, 2025",
