            "review_text": "yikes247\nPerth, Australia202 contributions\n0\nPoise for a great feed\nJul 2023 • Friends\nVery fresh seafood in fresh water tanks. Seafood is either raw, steamed, grilled, or stir-fried. Well cooked and delicious. As soon as the seafood was dished up on trays, the seafood was gone in minutes, practically. So popular and delicious. What a frenzy. There was quite an assortment of meat and seafood for hotpot, too. Plenty of salads and desserts too, as well as lots and lots of patrons too.\nMoney well spent.\nRead more\nWritten August 7, 2023",
